OL,3,ADeja Vu: Dancing with The Pussycat
OL,4,ADolls was surreal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA girl group that toured Europe with
OL,7,FThe Pussycat Dolls said it was
OL,8,F'surreal' to join their childhood
OL,9,Fheroes on stage.
OL,11,FDeja Vu, formed of Elle Botterill and
OL,12,FTyrece Lewis from Buckinghamshire
OL,13,Falongside Venezuelan-born Carolina
OL,14,FDiaz, performed their first-ever live
OL,15,Fshows during the 20-date arena tour
OL,16,Facross the UK and Europe.
OL,18,FThe group were left stunned when
OL,19,FKimberly Wyatt personally invited them
OL,20,Fto join the headliners during the dance
OL,21,Fbreak of their hit song, Buttons.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
