OL,3,ADeja Vu: Dancing with The Pussycat
OL,4,ADolls was surreal
OL,5,
OL,6,FBotterill said: "Even afterwards, we
OL,7,Fwere just like, 'I can't believe that's
OL,8,Factually just happened, we've been on
OL,9,Fstage dancing with The Pussycat Dolls
OL,10,Fin front of thousands of people'."
